<urn:usf:delivery-facet:abacpolicydecisionpointerrormodel> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Policy denial maps to 403, insufficient auth level maps to a step-up-required/401, a missing expected token maps to authentication-required/401, and static fallback without a permission maps to 403; every path is fail-closed by default. Server unavailability is an explicit non-decisive degradation, not an implicit allow." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
