<urn:usf:delivery-facet:accessibilitya11ygatecontracts> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "The contract is the accessibility expectation set (landmarks, roles, ARIA, and axe rules) that audited UI capabilities must satisfy, exercised by the e2e accessibility spec. Configuration is read from the declared provider/config plane and missing or invalid configuration fails closed instead of inventing defaults. The gate verdict is the contract that promotion decisions consume." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
