<urn:usf:delivery-facet:accessibilitya11ygateerrormodel> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Local failure returns a typed platform error or a readiness-degraded state without changing tenant-visible semantics; unavailable local dependencies fail closed through the readiness model. An accessibility violation produces a failing gate verdict rather than a silent pass. The risk class is semantic drift or configuration loss, not tenant data loss." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
