<urn:usf:delivery-facet:accessibilitya11ygatelifecycle> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Gate capability that asserts landmark, role, ARIA, and axe expectations as a contract over UI capabilities and gates promotion on them; it is neither provider-backed nor database-backed and owns no tenant records. It deploys the V1-proven e2e accessibility spec contract and must keep its lifecycle/readiness model unchanged during extraction, with migrations limited to contract/config references. Recovery re-runs the e2e accessibility spec before promotion continues." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
