<urn:usf:delivery-facet:accessibilitya11ygatereadinessmodel> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Readiness means the audited UI surfaces meet the accessibility expectations and the e2e accessibility spec passes; unavailable dependencies fail closed through the readiness model. Readiness is demonstrated by re-running the accessibility spec rather than by a live heartbeat. Missing, stale, or unknown results do not count as ready." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
