<urn:usf:delivery-facet:authenticationplatformcontracts> <urn:usf:predicate:facetKind> <urn:usf:facet-kind:contracts> <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
<urn:usf:delivery-facet:authenticationplatformcontracts> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "The operation surface covers login initiation, provider-callback handling, logout, server-side session lookup, an internal forward-auth check, and provider enumeration, plus tenant-scoped administration operations for identity-provider list/create/update/delete, OIDC discovery import, callback-URL derivation, non-interactive connection test, claim/role mapping read and full-replacement write, and MFA/lockout/session policy read and write. Mutations return a no-content success and reads return redacted projections; provider secrets and raw tokens are never exposed across the contract." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
