<urn:usf:delivery-facet:authenticationplatformproof> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Substrate and unit proofs cover login routes, the auth usecase, session fixtures, cookie security, token crypto, role/permission resolution, and audit-first ordering, while runtime proofs validate live identity-provider settings round-trips, IdP CRUD with secret rotation and redaction, OIDC discovery/JWKS/callback/test-connection, MFA and session policy write/read-back/restore, the claim-mapping semantic journey, and custom-domain callback derivation against local substrate. Proof is hermetic/runtime lineage; fresh proof remains pending." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
