<urn:usf:delivery-facet:backgroundworkersjobrunnercontracts> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "The external contract is GET /api/admin/workers, backed by an internal processNext handler registry and the JobRunnerPort with its PostgresJobAdapter; the event bus supplies the pending and dead-letter queues the runner consumes. Processing is expressed as claiming and completing event-bus records, so the worker contract composes with the event-bus contract rather than defining its own delivery semantics. The port seam keeps the job-execution provider swappable." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
