<urn:usf:delivery-facet:backgroundworkersjobrunnerpermissions> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "The only external surface, GET /api/admin/workers, is global and requires platform.workers.read; event processing itself is server-internal and is not callable by tenant UI. Workers therefore expose operational liveness to operators only and never offer direct tenant-triggered job execution. Tenant context on processed events is preserved through the event records the worker claims." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
