<urn:usf:delivery-facet:backgroundworkersjobrunnerproof> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Behaviour is grounded in the event-worker runtime proof, which validates live Postgres claim, process, idempotent skip, retry, dead-letter, and heartbeat (level-4 live substrate validation), captured here as informational semantic lineage from the USF coverage record and equivalence audit with no source import and an open implementation language. The proof expectation is the lineage evidence, not a current USF readiness verdict. Proof is hermetic/runtime lineage; fresh proof remains pending." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
