<urn:usf:delivery-facet:backupandrestoreuisemantics> <urn:usf:predicate:facetKind> <urn:usf:facet-kind:uisemantics> <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
<urn:usf:delivery-facet:backupandrestoreuisemantics> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "The backupandrestore capability is explicitly not exposed; no product or operator UI is authorised. Any UI requires a deliberate exposure amendment." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
