<urn:usf:delivery-facet:backupandrestorevalidation> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Backup validates the environment guard (refusing non-dev/test environments absent the explicit allow override) before dumping; restore validates both the dev/test environment constraint and the exact confirmation token before overwriting. The stage-level destructive-allowed and data-preservation settings from the environment registry further gate whether destructive operations may run at all in a given stage." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
