<urn:usf:delivery-facet:brandingandthemingauditmodel> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "The theme bootstrap read is read-only and emits no mutation audit, while branding configuration mutations emit value-changed or value-cleared audit actions before the tenant settings are written. As with the configuration registry, the audit precedes the persistence change for every branding edit." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
