<urn:usf:delivery-facet:brandingandthemingcontracts> <urn:usf:predicate:facetKind> <urn:usf:facet-kind:contracts> <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
<urn:usf:delivery-facet:brandingandthemingcontracts> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "The contract surface is a bootstrap theme read that returns the effective theme for the resolved host, plus the configuration registry's list/patch/delete operations scoped to branding definitions. Both paths sit behind the configuration-store port and adapter, so theme delivery and branding management share one persistence contract expressed abstractly." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
