<urn:usf:delivery-facet:brandingandthemingerrormodel> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Theme read failures are non-blocking and fall back to the default theme so the client shell can always render, whereas branding mutations use the configuration error mapping for validation, forbidden, unknown-key, and non-overridable outcomes. The bootstrap path is deliberately fail-open to defaults while the management path is fail-closed." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
