<urn:usf:delivery-facet:brandingandthemingstatemodel> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "State comprises a static default theme plus tenant-scoped theme override keys consumed by the runtime theme response, alongside registry-managed branding definitions (application name typed as a string and a theme selection constrained to system/light/dark). Bootstrap theme state and editable branding-registry state are kept distinct so the pre-auth response stays simple while managed edits carry full definition semantics." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
