<urn:usf:delivery-facet:configurationregistryandhistorycontracts> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "The interface exposes a list operation filterable by category that returns serialised definitions paired with effective value and source, a patch operation that sets a single key's override from a supplied value, and a delete operation that clears an override. Operation semantics are mediated by a configuration-store port with a persistent adapter so the contract is independent of the storage technology." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
