<urn:usf:delivery-facet:configurationregistryandhistoryerrormodel> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Outcomes are deterministic and fail-closed: invalid input maps to a validation error, unknown keys to not-found, non-overridable definitions to an unprocessable-entity outcome, insufficient permission to forbidden, and absence of tenant context to a bad-request; successful writes and deletes return no-content. Best-effort change-notification fan-out is decoupled and its failure never rolls back the committed configuration mutation." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
