<urn:usf:delivery-facet:configurationregistryandhistorypermissions> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Reads require a tenant-scoped configuration-read permission and additionally filter the visible definitions by each definition's required read permission; mutations require a tenant-scoped configuration-write permission and the use case re-enforces each definition's required write permission. Feature-flag definitions require dedicated feature permissions, and all resolution is tenant-isolated so one tenant never observes another tenant's overrides." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
