<urn:usf:delivery-facet:environmentregistryandbootstrapcontracts> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "The interface contract is the environment-registry repository port plus the bootstrap operation that maps manifests to generated environment configuration. Configuration is read from the declared provider/config plane and missing or invalid configuration fails closed instead of inventing UI defaults. The generated configuration is the contract downstream services consume to start in a given environment." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
