<urn:usf:delivery-facet:environmentregistryandbootstraplifecycle> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Registers environments and bootstraps their configuration, turning declared manifests into generated environment configuration; it is provider-backed but owns no tenant records. It deploys the V1-proven contract manifests-to-generated-.env and must keep its lifecycle/readiness model unchanged during extraction, with migrations limited to contract/config references that update semantic artefacts when behaviour changes. Recovery re-runs proof:environment-registry, proof:environment-admin-bootstrap, and proof:environment-operations before promotion continues." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
