<urn:usf:delivery-facet:environmentregistryandbootstrappermissions> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Environment registration and bootstrap are operator/admin actions; the capability owns no tenant data, so standard platform security controls apply rather than per-tenant roles. Bootstrap reads from the declared provider/config plane and resolves secrets through the secrets boundary rather than embedding them. Mutating the environment registry must keep mutation boundaries closed on failure." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
