<urn:usf:delivery-facet:eventbusdurablequeuesdlqredriveauditmodel> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Operator redrive emits an event.redriven audit record under audit-before-change semantics, so the audit write precedes the state mutation. Event publication and worker processing are captured as durable operational records and worker heartbeats rather than as user-mutation audit events, and redrive audit excludes the underlying payload. This separation keeps the operational telemetry distinct from the privileged-action audit trail." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
