<urn:usf:delivery-facet:eventbusdurablequeuesdlqredrivecontracts> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "The external operator contract is GET /api/admin/events, GET /api/admin/events/dead-letter, and POST /api/admin/events/:eventId/redrive, with publishing and worker processing exposed only as server-internal use-case contracts behind the EventBusPort and its PostgresEventBusAdapter. Schema changes to canonical events require a new schemaVersion, backwards-compatible consumers, and migration/redrive compatibility evidence before promotion. The port/adapter seam keeps the persistence provider swappable without changing the operation semantics." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
