<urn:usf:delivery-facet:eventbusdurablequeuesdlqredriveerrormodel> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Outcomes are deterministic and fail closed: a duplicate publish is deduplicated, a handler that exhausts maxAttempts is dead-lettered, a missing organisationId returns 400, an invalid redrive id returns 400, and an unavailable Postgres substrate yields an honest skip or readiness failure rather than a fabricated success. Errors are typed and logged with organisationId when tenant-scoped, and no failure path echoes secret-bearing payload fields." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
