<urn:usf:delivery-facet:eventbusdurablequeuesdlqredriveproof> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Behaviour is exercised by three runtime proofs: event-bus validates live Postgres outbox persistence, row-level security, and secret-payload rejection; event-worker validates processing, retry, dead-letter, and heartbeat; event-redrive validates the live admin routes and requeue, with the corpus describing this as level-4 live substrate and route validation. The proofs are the lineage evidence, not a USF readiness claim. Proof is hermetic/runtime lineage; fresh proof remains pending." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
