<urn:usf:delivery-facet:eventbusdurablequeuesdlqredrivevalidation> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Publish rejects payload fields that carry secrets, preserves the tenant id, and deduplicates repeated idempotency keys; list routes require organisationId and return 400 when it is missing, and redrive rejects an invalid or unknown event id with 400. Row-level security additionally hides foreign-tenant events so validation cannot be bypassed by id guessing. Invariants are exercised by the event-bus and event-redrive runtime proofs." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
