<urn:usf:delivery-facet:historyreadmodelreadonlyprojectionauditmodel> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "The capability is itself a window onto the audit/history record set, presenting a safe summarised view; reads preserve tenant context through spans and typed logs carry the tenant/organisation identifier when tenant-scoped. It never writes, so it adds no mutation audit of its own beyond the access trail. The underlying audit records it projects remain the canonical evidence." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
