<urn:usf:delivery-facet:historyreadmodelreadonlyprojectioncontracts> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "The contract is two read operations (tenant history and admin tenant history) returning the paged, summarised projection shape with no write side. The repository port defines the query and paging contract, and the projection guarantees the exclusion of raw payloads and secrets as a contract obligation. As a read-only surface it participates in backup/export/retention semantics only as a consumer of the underlying records." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
