<urn:usf:delivery-facet:i18nruntimeandvalidationauditmodel> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Because it performs no tenant mutation, its audit concern is the validation record: the duplicate list, raw-literal findings, and strict/report-only exit state form the reviewable evidence of i18n conformance. These findings remain visible so locale governance is inspectable. Recovery re-runs the validation so the conformance claim stays evidence-backed." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
