<urn:usf:delivery-facet:i18nruntimeandvalidationlifecycle> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Provides runtime internationalisation with locale resolution plus a validation gate that ensures required keys exist and raw literals are governed, treating UI strings as contractual; it is database-backed in lineage but owns no tenant records. It deploys the V1-proven packages/i18n-runtime contract and must keep its lifecycle/readiness model unchanged during extraction, with the validation gate run as a build/promotion check. Recovery re-runs the i18n-runtime package and its validation before promotion continues." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
