<urn:usf:delivery-facet:logsaggregationandtenantscopedsearchlifecycle> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Aggregates application and audit logs into a queryable log store and exposes a tenant-scoped search contract (log search plus an observability readiness query) that admins use to investigate behaviour within a single tenant boundary. The capability is provider-backed and tenant-data-owning, so the lifecycle/readiness model must be preserved unchanged across extraction and every search request carries and enforces the tenant context." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
