<urn:usf:delivery-facet:logsaggregationandtenantscopedsearchpermissions> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Search and readiness operations are admin-gated and hard-bound to a single tenant: every query is scoped to the caller's organisation id so one tenant can never read another tenant's log entries. Permission, audit, and fail-closed checks are treated as security-sensitive invariants that must survive extraction unchanged, and missing tenant context fails the request rather than widening scope." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
