<urn:usf:delivery-facet:metricsandtracescontracts> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Provides a metrics query operation and a readiness query behind ports/adapters so the metrics and trace providers (e.g. Prometheus and an OTel collector feeding Tempo) are swappable without changing the contract. The emitted metric names follow a stable per-capability convention (request total, failure total, readiness state) and traces expose route/use-case/provider spans that carry tenant context end to end." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
