<urn:usf:delivery-facet:metricsandtraceslifecycle> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Exposes platform metrics and distributed traces through an admin observability metrics contract and an observability readiness query, giving operators time-series and span visibility into platform behaviour. The capability is provider-backed but owns no tenant records; it affects shared platform behaviour and must keep its lifecycle/readiness model stable across extraction." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
