<urn:usf:delivery-facet:metricsandtracespermissions> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Metrics and readiness operations are admin-gated under standard platform security controls; since no tenant rows are owned, isolation is enforced through scoped attributes (organisation/tenant id on signals and spans) rather than row-level data ownership. Access to the shared observability surface still fails closed when configuration or permission is missing." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
