<urn:usf:delivery-facet:metricsandtracesreadinessmodel> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Readiness is a queryable posture covering metrics and trace pipelines that degrades explicitly when the metrics provider or OTel collector is unavailable, disabling dependent side-effect paths while keeping read-only readiness and audit visible. Emitted readiness, error, and audit signals use the controlled, OpenTelemetry-informed observability vocabulary without claiming OpenTelemetry compliance." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
