<urn:usf:delivery-facet:metricsandtracesstatemodel> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "It owns no database schema: durable storage lives in the metrics/trace backends (a Prometheus-style series store and an OTLP/Tempo-style trace store) reached through ports, while the capability holds only contract/config and a readiness record. Spans preserve tenant and request context as attributes for correlation, and behaviour changes must update the corresponding semantic artefacts rather than introducing an owned schema." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
