<urn:usf:delivery-facet:notificationdeliveryandpreferencesandchannelsauditmodel> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Preference changes and operator test sends are audit-before-change or audit-before-action operations, so the audit record precedes the effect. Dispatch records a durable per-attempt status (sent, suppressed, or failed), and the audit metadata deliberately excludes secret-bearing payload content. This separates auditable operator and user actions from the durable delivery log." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
