<urn:usf:delivery-facet:notificationdeliveryandpreferencesandchannelscontracts> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "The contract surface is GET and PATCH /api/me/notification-preferences, GET /api/admin/notifications/readiness, and POST /api/admin/tenants/:tenantId/notifications/test, fronting a NotificationTransportPort with email and webhook transport adapters. Producer capabilities such as the workflow engine request notifications through the shared event contract rather than calling transports directly. The port seam keeps each transport provider swappable behind a uniform dispatch contract." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
