<urn:usf:delivery-facet:notificationdeliveryandpreferencesandchannelserrormodel> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Outcomes are deterministic and fail closed: states include sent, suppressed, failed, readiness unavailable or degraded, no-tenant, validation error, invalid tenant id, and transport non-2xx failure, with each surfaced explicitly. Degraded mode disables the transport-dependent mutation and side-effect paths while keeping read-only readiness and audit visible. No failure path fabricates a successful send or echoes secret payload fields." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
