<urn:usf:delivery-facet:notificationdeliveryandpreferencesandchannelspermissions> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Self-service preference reads and writes use profile.read_self and profile.update_self with tenant context derived from the request host, while operator readiness and test-send routes are global and require platform.notifications.read or platform.notifications.write. A user can therefore manage only their own preferences, and operator test sends are gated behind operator permissions. Tenant isolation must be preserved because the capability holds tenant-visible data." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
