<urn:usf:delivery-facet:notificationdeliveryandpreferencesandchannelsproof> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Behaviour is exercised by the notification-preferences, notification-dispatch, notification-email-transport, notification-webhook-transport, and notification-transport-routes runtime proofs, described in the corpus as level-4 live Postgres, Mailpit, and webhook route validation. The proofs are the lineage evidence, not a USF readiness claim. Proof is hermetic/runtime lineage; fresh proof remains pending." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
