<urn:usf:delivery-facet:notificationdeliveryandpreferencesandchannelsstatemodel> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "State comprises preferences keyed by organisation, user, channel, and category with an enabled flag; a notification log with status sent|suppressed|failed; channel transports of email|webhook|local; resolved recipients; and per-channel readiness availability. This capability holds tenant data, so its records participate in tenant backup, export, retention, and legal-hold semantics. Recipient resolution and preference state are tenant-scoped and audit metadata deliberately excludes secret-bearing payloads." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
