<urn:usf:delivery-facet:providerenvironmentclassificationlifecycle> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Classification capability that places each provider on an environment-posture axis (hermetic, local, sandbox, live) while keeping provider mode and environment as separate honest dimensions; it is provider-backed but owns no database schema. It deploys the V1-proven env-classification matrix contract and must keep its lifecycle/readiness model unchanged during extraction, with migrations limited to contract/config references that update semantic artefacts when behaviour changes. Recovery re-runs proof:provider-environment-classification before promotion continues." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
