<urn:usf:delivery-facet:ratelimitingapicontracts> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "API contracts are a tenant rate-limit read, an operator per-tenant rate-limit read, and an operator per-tenant rate-limit update, with developer-portal exposure of rate-limit summaries. The interface is a rate-limit port with both a cache adapter and a relational adapter behind it." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
