<urn:usf:delivery-facet:ratelimitingapilifecycle> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "The rate-limit lifecycle is explicit: an operator sets a per-tenant policy, evaluation checks entitlement before counting, requests move within a fixed window from allowed below or at the limit to denied above the limit, and live counts reset in a new window bucket. No configured policy means opt-in allow." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
