<urn:usf:delivery-facet:rbacrolesandpermissionscontracts> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "The contract is the role and permission vocabulary published by the identity domain and drift-checked against the admin contract's tenant-role and membership-status definitions, surfaced operationally through the member role and status update operations. The vocabulary is a versioned semantic surface rather than a runtime route set." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
