<urn:usf:delivery-facet:rbacrolesandpermissionserrormodel> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Invalid role updates return an invalid-body outcome, missing memberships return not-found, and last-admin demotion, removal, or disable return explicit unprocessable-entity validation outcomes; permission denial is handled fail-closed by the request pipeline before any route handler runs. No partial role state is left on a rejected change." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
