<urn:usf:delivery-facet:rbacrolesandpermissionslifecycle> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "The capability assigns roles and deterministically resolves them into permissions: tenant membership roles (tenant-admin, manager, member, viewer) are assigned through the member role-update path, system-admin is a global role that is rejected as a membership role, and any role change re-resolves the actor's permission bundle. Roles are convenience bundles while permissions are the enforcement primitive." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
