<urn:usf:delivery-facet:runtimesecretsmanagementcontracts> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "The contract surface is GET and POST /api/admin/secrets, POST /api/admin/secrets/revoke, POST /api/admin/secrets/delete, and GET /api/admin/secrets/readiness, fronting a SecretStorePort with put, list, getMetadata, resolve, revoke, delete, and readiness operations behind the OpenBao and Postgres secret adapters. The port seam keeps the secret backend swappable, and resolve is deliberately the only value-returning operation. Readiness payloads carry no secret-bearing fields." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
