<urn:usf:delivery-facet:runtimesecretsmanagementerrormodel> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Outcomes are deterministic and fail closed: a revoked, deleted, or cross-tenant ref resolves to null; an unreachable OpenBao reports degraded; an unavailable built-in Postgres degrades or skips honestly in proof; and no contract echoes a secret value on any failure path. Degraded mode disables the adapter-dependent mutation paths while keeping read-only readiness and audit visible, and no silent fallback upgrades provider readiness." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
