<urn:usf:delivery-facet:runtimesecretsmanagementpermissions> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Admin secret routes require platform.secrets.read or platform.secrets.write and are operator-only; there is no tenant UI surface in this pass. Tenant isolation prevents one organisation from resolving, reading, or enumerating another organisation's ref, enforced at the store layer. This is a security-sensitive capability, so permission, audit, and fail-closed behaviour must be preserved on every path." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
