<urn:usf:delivery-facet:runtimesecretsmanagementproof> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Behaviour is exercised by three runtime proofs: secret-store-contract validates the live Postgres store contract, encryption, row-level security, and audit; secrets-openbao validates the live OpenBao provider; and provider-secrets-readiness validates the ready versus degraded classification, described in the corpus as level-4 live provider and storage validation. The proofs are the lineage evidence, not a USF readiness claim. Proof is hermetic/runtime lineage; fresh proof remains pending." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
