<urn:usf:delivery-facet:scheduledjobsbuiltinontheeventsubstratecontracts> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "The contract surface is GET and POST /api/admin/scheduled-jobs, POST /api/admin/scheduled-jobs/:jobId/run, and PATCH /api/admin/scheduled-jobs/:jobId, with the periodic due tick exposed only as a server-internal operation behind the EventBusPort and PostgresEventBusAdapter. Enqueue is expressed as event publication, so the scheduled-job contract composes with the event-bus contract rather than duplicating delivery semantics. The port seam keeps the substrate provider swappable." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
