<urn:usf:delivery-facet:scheduledjobsbuiltinontheeventsubstrateerrormodel> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Outcomes are deterministic and fail closed: a missing organisationId returns 400, an invalid job id returns 400, a disabled job is simply not due, a repeated due tick within the window is deduplicated, and an unavailable Postgres substrate yields an honest skip or readiness failure rather than a fabricated enqueue. Errors are typed and tenant-scoped and never silently drop scheduled work." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
