<urn:usf:delivery-facet:scheduledjobsbuiltinontheeventsubstratepermissions> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Scheduled-job routes are global, operator-only platform surfaces: listing requires platform.jobs.read while create, run-now, and patch require platform.jobs.write. The due tick is server-internal and is not callable from tenant UI. Tenant isolation is enforced by organisationId scoping and row-level security so one organisation cannot list or trigger another organisation's jobs." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
