<urn:usf:delivery-facet:scheduledjobsbuiltinontheeventsubstratevalidation> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "List routes require organisationId, invalid job ids are rejected, create validates the schedule body, run-now validates the job id, and the same-window idempotency window prevents duplicate event enqueue for a job that has already fired in the current window. Disabled jobs are never enqueued by the due tick. These invariants are exercised by the scheduled-jobs and scheduled-job-routes runtime proofs." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
