<urn:usf:delivery-facet:searchandindexingproductsearchauditmodel> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Search and reindex operations preserve tenant context through route/use-case/provider spans, with typed error logs carrying the tenant/organisation identifier when tenant-scoped, and readiness transitions are observable as a signal. Indexed metadata excludes secrets so audit and logs do not surface sensitive content. Recovery must preserve tenant boundary and audit." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
