<urn:usf:delivery-facet:searchandindexingproductsearcherrormodel> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "The model is fail-closed: a query under one tenant context must return zero rows from another tenant, an unready engine reports degraded or blocked rather than serving stale or unscoped results, and provider failure returns a typed degraded or readiness error with mutation boundaries closed. The search surface never fabricates results or exposes secret metadata. Tenant data cannot be silently dropped or remapped." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
<urn:usf:delivery-facet:searchandindexingproductsearcherrormodel> <urn:usf:predicate:requirementClass> "behavioural-runtime" <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
