<urn:usf:delivery-facet:searchandindexingproductsearchlifecycle> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Provides tenant product search backed by full-text indexing with a reindex path and a readiness probe, exposed through tenant search and admin search readiness and reindex operations; documents are indexed into a tenant-scoped relational full-text store and queried with permission gating. Indexed documents are kept in sync with their sources and can be rebuilt via reindex. The search engine is a full-text-search adapter behind a port, with alternative engines available as future provider adapters." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
<urn:usf:delivery-facet:searchandindexingproductsearchlifecycle> <urn:usf:predicate:requirementClass> "permissions-security" <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
