<urn:usf:delivery-facet:searchandindexingproductsearchpermissions> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Search results are isolated by tenant under the canonical row-level-security predicate and further gated by an optional per-document permission key so a user only sees documents they are entitled to, never another tenant's documents. Admin readiness and reindex are operator-scoped privileged operations. Indexed metadata deliberately omits secret fields so the search surface cannot leak sensitive values." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
