<urn:usf:delivery-facet:searchandindexingproductsearchreadinessmodel> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Readiness is reported by the full-text engine probe as ready, degraded, or blocked, and is verified by isolation and route proofs; the capability degrades explicitly when the search adapter is unavailable, disabling index mutation while keeping read-only readiness and audit visible. Readiness being blocked, a failed search/search-isolation/search-routes proof during promotion, or a missing isolation or audit signal raise alerts and block promotion." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
