<urn:usf:delivery-facet:searchandindexingproductsearchstatemodel> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Each indexed document carries a tenant/organisation id, document id, document type, title, a full-text search vector with an associated index, a URL, non-secret metadata, and an optional permission key, with uniqueness on tenant plus type plus document id. Readiness is reported as a full-text-search engine with status ready, degraded, or blocked. The index store is a tenant-scoped relational table under row-level security and excludes secret fields from indexed metadata." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
