<urn:usf:delivery-facet:servicecatalogandproviderintegrationmodellifecycle> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Registers platform services and their provider integration model, governing how each service is built, composed, or adapted and how it is exposed; it is provider-backed, database-backed, and touches tenant data. It deploys the V1-proven contract for platform-services readiness and GET /api/platform/service-catalog (catalog v2) and must keep its lifecycle/readiness model unchanged during extraction. Recovery re-runs proof:platform-services, proof:service-clickthrough-policy, proof:service-catalog-registry, and proof:entitlements-routes before promotion continues." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
