<urn:usf:delivery-facet:subscriptionsinvoicespaymentmethodsdunningcontracts> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "The interface is a billing-provider port abstracting subscription, invoice, payment-method, charge, refund, and dunning operations, with an external provider adapter and an in-memory payment provider behind it. Idempotency keys for payment and usage are part of the contract so retried submissions converge on a single outcome, and responses are normalised into explicit amount/currency/status DTOs." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
