<urn:usf:delivery-facet:tenantdataimportexportstatemodel> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Durable import progress is keyed by tenant/organisation and the archive's content digest and tracks completed units plus an optional failed unit, persisted by a dedicated migration; it deliberately stores no payload or secret material. The transported payload is an encrypted compressed archive built on export and consumed on import; the canonical tenant data itself lives in the relational store and is read or written through repository ports. Progress is idempotent against re-runs of the same archive digest." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
