<urn:usf:delivery-facet:tenantserviceclickthroughpolicycontracts> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Exposes an access-decision operation that returns granted/denied with a reason and a clickthrough URL, behind ports/adapters so the reverse-proxy reconciler is swappable without changing the policy contract. The derived forward-auth sets and reconciled proxy configuration are the contract's side effects, kept deterministic so the edge enforcement always matches the computed policy." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
