<urn:usf:delivery-facet:tenantserviceclickthroughpolicyerrormodel> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Provider or reconciler failure returns a typed degraded/readiness failure and keeps mutation boundaries closed, never fabricating a granted decision or a successful reconciliation. Because access is tenant-affecting, a denied or indeterminate decision defaults to no access, and tenant data/policy loss is possible only if migration/restore semantics are bypassed." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
