<urn:usf:delivery-facet:tenantserviceclickthroughpolicylifecycle> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Decides, per tenant and per service, whether a user may click through to an internal/composed service and derives the forward-auth allow sets plus the reverse-proxy (Caddyfile) reconciliation that enforce that decision at the edge. The capability is provider- and database-backed and owns tenant-affecting access policy, so its lifecycle/readiness model must be preserved and reconciliation kept consistent with the policy." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
