<urn:usf:delivery-facet:tenantserviceclickthroughpolicypermissions> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Clickthrough decisions are the permission model: access is computed from system-admin and tenant-admin resource sets and the service classification, and the resulting forward-auth sets gate edge access per tenant. This is a security-sensitive surface where permission, audit, and fail-closed behaviour must be preserved; a service not explicitly granted is denied, and dev-only services are excluded outside the appropriate context." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
