<urn:usf:delivery-facet:universalservicefoundationscopeandprincipleslifecycle> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Governing meta-capability that defines the foundation's posture (semantic-first, evidence-backed, hermetically provable, AI-safe) and the lifecycle every other capability must honour rather than a CRUD service of its own. Its operational lifecycle is the V2 extraction lifecycle: each capability deploys a V1-proven contract and must keep its semanticCompleteness lifecycle/readiness model unchanged through extraction, with promotion only after the foundation matrix, registry, and validation checks pass. It owns no tenant records and is classified as a provider-dependency foundation concern whose health is the integrity of the foundation asset graph." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
