<urn:usf:delivery-facet:universalservicefoundationscopeandprinciplesproof> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Proof for this capability is the foundation matrix plus the registry and validation test that demonstrate the corpus is internally consistent and that each capability's claims are backed by evidence, not assertion. Historical demonstration is via that hermetic foundation tooling rather than live external runtime. Proof is hermetic/runtime lineage; fresh proof remains pending." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
