<urn:usf:delivery-facet:workflowenginescheduledjobsapprovalscontracts> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "The contract surface is GET /api/admin/workflows, GET /api/admin/workflows/readiness, POST /api/admin/workflows/start, GET /api/admin/workflows/:workflowId, POST /api/admin/workflows/:workflowId/signal, and POST /api/admin/workflows/:workflowId/cancel, fronting a WorkflowOrchestratorPort behind the Temporal provider adapter or the in-memory orchestrator. Scheduled-job dispatch and notification requests flow outward as events after readiness checks. The port seam keeps the workflow provider swappable without changing the lifecycle contract." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
