<urn:usf:delivery-facet:workflowenginescheduledjobsapprovalserrormodel> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Errors are fail-closed: an unknown workflow read or invalid id is a typed error, an unavailable provider is a readiness/degraded state rather than a fabricated success, a denied approval yields failed, a cancel yields cancelled, and a cross-tenant access attempt returns false. Degraded mode disables mutation and side-effect paths that depend on the provider adapter while keeping read-only readiness and audit visible." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
