<urn:usf:delivery-facet:workflowenginescheduledjobsapprovalspermissions> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "Admin workflow operations require platform.workflow.* permissions (read for inspection, write for start, signal, and cancel), while exposed tenant read surfaces use tenant.workflow.read. Workflow ids are tenant-bound and the canAccess predicate denies cross-tenant access, so an operator or tenant cannot drive or observe another tenant's workflow. Tenant context, secrets, and provider credentials do not cross the capability boundary except through the declared contract." <urn:usf:graph:v3-delivery> .
